WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.307
AHH!

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:09.843
- AHH!

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:11.745
OMEGA PI OMEGA!

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.847
- OMEGA PI OMEGA!

00:00:13.881 --> 00:00:17.651
- [barking]
OMEGA PI OMEGA!

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.786
- OMEGA PI OMEGA!
- YEAH!

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.154
- YO, BRAND ME, SON.
- YEAH.

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:22.656
- BRAND ME,
DO IT ON MY CHEST.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:23.991
- YEAH.
- STRAIGHT DOWN THE MIDDLE, SON.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.092
- YEAH, YEAH,
YEAH, YEAH, YEAH!

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:28.428
- AHH!

00:00:28.462 --> 00:00:29.963
- YEAH, SON!

00:00:29.997 --> 00:00:32.232
- OH, YEAH--YO...
YO, YO, HOLD UP, MAN.

00:00:32.266 --> 00:00:33.200
COME ON, WAIT.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.601
WAIT, WAIT, THAT'S...

00:00:34.635 --> 00:00:36.436
THAT [bleep]
IS UPSIDE-DOWN, SON.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.906
IT--IT'S TO THE SIDE
A LITTLE BIT TOO.

00:00:38.939 --> 00:00:41.108
- OH, [bleep], WELL, OKAY,
MY--MY BAD, DOG.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.709
MY BAD, DOG. YOU WANNA
KEEP DOING THIS [bleep]?

00:00:42.743 --> 00:00:44.945
LET'S GO!
- YEAH, MAN.

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:47.481
I'M JUST--I'M SAYING,
YO, BE CAREFUL.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:48.815
- I GOT YOU, DOG,
I GOT YOU...YEAH!

00:00:48.849 --> 00:00:50.918
- AHH!

00:00:50.951 --> 00:00:52.853
- WHAT'S UP?
THAT'S WHAT'S UP!

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.788
- YEAH.
- STRAIGHT DOWN THE MIDDLE, SON!

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:57.057
- YOU CAN'T GO BACK
MIDDLE NOW, SON.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.525
- WHAT?
- WE ALREADY COMMITTED

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.261
TO THE UPSIDE-DOWN
AND TO THE SIDE.

00:01:01.295 --> 00:01:05.899
- I GOT YOU, DOG, YEAH!
- AHH!

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:07.401
WHAT ARE YOU
DOING, MAN?

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.269
- YOU SAID UPSIDE-DOWN
AND TO THE SIDE.

00:01:09.303 --> 00:01:10.537
- THAT'S THREE OMEGAS!

00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:12.272
- OH, MAN,
I FORGOT THE PI.

00:01:12.306 --> 00:01:16.977
YEAH!
- AHH!

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:21.281
OH...

00:01:21.315 --> 00:01:23.116
- OH, MAN,
I MEAN, YOU KNOW...

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.219
THAT--THAT, MAN...
THAT--THAT...

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:26.220
THAT COULD BE
A ROCKET SHIP,

00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:28.288
OR--OR
A LIGHTHOUSE.

00:01:28.322 --> 00:01:33.093
NAW, MAN, YOU STRAIGHT UP
GOT A [bleep] ON YOUR CHEST.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:36.096
- AHH!

